# ---- Quality presets ----
profile.LOW=Low
profile.LOW.comment=Favors responsiveness. Disables water refraction, GI, colored lighting and parallax; retains waves, water reflections, basic shadows and material highlights.
profile.MID=Mid
profile.MID.comment=Balanced. Enables water refraction, single-bounce GI, a 32-block colored-light volume and basic parallax, with reduced volume sampling.
profile.HIGH=High
profile.HIGH.comment=Favors quality with multibounce GI, a 48-block colored-light volume, higher parallax, soft shadows and reflected clouds. Targets about 30 FPS.
profile.ULTRA=Ultra
profile.ULTRA.comment=Higher GI precision, a 64-block colored-light volume, parallax, shadows and volume sampling. Targets about 30 FPS, depending on scene and GPU.
option.shadowMapResolution = Shadow Resolution
option.shadowDistance = Shadow Distance
option.WATER_REFLECTION_CLOUDS = Reflected Clouds
value.WATER_REFLECTION_CLOUDS.0 = Lookup
value.WATER_REFLECTION_CLOUDS.1 = Per-pixel
option.WATER_REFLECTION_STEPS=Water Trace Steps
option.WATER_REFLECTION_STEPS.comment=Controls water transmission tracing and related cache budgets. Surface SSR retains the fixed BSL search budget.
option.REFLECTION_OCCLUSION_STEPS=Secondary Optical Steps
option.REFLECTION_OCCLUSION_STEPS.comment=Controls the secondary-view search for refractive surfaces. Legacy 0 and 6 both select the six-step minimum.

option.BLOOM_RESOLUTION=Bloom Resolution
value.BLOOM_RESOLUTION.0=Half
value.BLOOM_RESOLUTION.1=Full
option.BLOOM_RESOLUTION.comment=Scales only the bloom viewport. Half reduces filtering cost; full preserves finer highlights.

option.AIR_SCATTER_STEPS=Sunlight Scatter Steps
option.AIR_SCATTER_STEPS.comment=Fixed integration intervals. Lower saves shadow lookups; higher improves thin-beam stability.
option.WATER_SHAFT_STEPS=Underwater Shaft Steps
option.WATER_SHAFT_STEPS.comment=Underwater scattering steps, independent of caustic texture quality.
option.FOLIAGE_TRANSLUCENCY=Foliage Translucency
option.FOLIAGE_TRANSLUCENCY.comment=Sun and moon transmission through thin leaves and plants, bounded by shadow material and thickness. 0 disables it.

option.VOLUMETRIC_RESOLUTION=Volume Resolution
value.VOLUMETRIC_RESOLUTION.0=Quarter
value.VOLUMETRIC_RESOLUTION.1=Half
option.VOLUMETRIC_RESOLUTION.comment=Uses quarter or half width and height for the volume field, followed by depth-aware reconstruction.

