option.GI_QUALITY.comment=Controls the per-frame budget and precision of indirect transport. Higher quality converges faster at greater cost.
option.GI_MULTIBOUNCE.comment=Reflect indirect light again at surfaces. Disable for a single surface bounce.
option.GI_STRENGTH.comment=Scales indirect light only. Zero hides GI while keeping transport active.
option.GI_REFLECTANCE.comment=Energy retained by later surface reflections, multiplied by material albedo.
option.ENABLE_COLOURED_LIGHTING.comment=Enable direct light colors. Ordinary block lighting remains when disabled; GI retains shared voxel work.
option.COLOURED_VOLUME_SIZE.comment=Horizontal extent shared by colored lighting and GI. Vertical extent is half this value.
option.COLOURED_LIGHT_STEPS.comment=Propagation passes per frame shared by colored lighting and indirect transport. More passes converge faster at higher cost.
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH = Wave strength
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH.comment = Controls moving wave height and visible ripple contrast.


option.AA_MODE=FXAA
value.AA_MODE.0=Off
value.AA_MODE.1=FXAA Fast
value.AA_MODE.2=FXAA Quality
option.AA_MODE.comment=Single-frame antialiasing used when TAA is disabled: off, fast or quality. Quality presets preserve this choice.
option.ENABLE_TAA=Temporal AA
option.PUDDLE_REFLECTION_STRENGTH=Puddle mirror strength
option.PUDDLE_REFLECTION_STRENGTH.comment=Thin-film scene and sky reflections with Fresnel-weighted ground transmission and local highlights.
option.RAIN_FOG_ALTITUDE=Rain fog altitude
option.ENABLE_LIGHTNING=Lightning illumination
option.ENABLE_LIGHTNING.comment=Real strikes illuminate clouds and mist. HDR radiance blooms beyond cloud edges while native ground flashes remain.
option.LIGHTNING_STRENGTH=Lightning strength
option.LIGHTNING_STRENGTH.comment=Overall arc, cloud-scattering and mist illumination strength.
option.RAIN_FOG_ALTITUDE.comment=Altitude falloff for distant mist; observed native ground enhances nearby low fog.
value.ENABLE_TAA.0=Off
value.ENABLE_TAA.1=On
option.ENABLE_TAA.comment=Independently controls temporal accumulation, projection jitter and TAA sharpening. Disabling uses the FXAA setting; quality presets preserve this switch.

