option.ENABLE_CHUNK_TRANSITION=Smooth chunk transition
option.ENABLE_CHUNK_TRANSITION.comment=Blends the render-distance boundary with directional sky; supported Iris versions also fade newly loaded chunk coverage.
option.CHUNK_TRANSITION_WIDTH=Boundary transition width
option.CHUNK_TRANSITION_WIDTH.comment=Width in blocks, limited to the final fifth of render distance. Nearby terrain stays clear.
option.TAA_HISTORY_WEIGHT=History weight
option.TAA_HISTORY_WEIGHT.comment=Higher values stabilize stationary detail; depth and colour changes still limit moving history.
option.TAA_SHARPNESS=Temporal sharpness
option.ENABLE_MOTION_BLUR=Motion blur
option.ENABLE_MOTION_BLUR.comment=Integrates camera motion while preserving the viewmodel. Water reflection blur is bypassed when this is enabled.
option.MOTION_BLUR_SHUTTER=Shutter fraction
option.MOTION_BLUR_SHUTTER.comment=0.5 approximates a 180-degree shutter. Lower frame rates produce longer trails at the same camera speed.
option.MOTION_BLUR_MAX_RADIUS=Maximum blur radius
option.ENABLE_DOF=Depth of field
option.DOF_QUALITY=DOF samples
value.DOF_QUALITY.1=16 samples
value.DOF_QUALITY.2=32 samples
option.DOF_FOCUS_MODE=Focus mode
value.DOF_FOCUS_MODE.0=Centre autofocus
value.DOF_FOCUS_MODE.1=Manual distance
option.DOF_FOCUS_DISTANCE=Focus distance
option.DOF_FOCUS_DISTANCE.comment=Manual distance in blocks; autofocus reads world depth at the screen centre.
option.DOF_APERTURE=Aperture f-number
option.DOF_APERTURE.comment=Lower values produce stronger defocus. The viewmodel stays sharp; the HUD is drawn after post-processing.
option.DOF_STRENGTH=DOF strength
option.ENABLE_AUTO_EXPOSURE=Auto exposure
option.ENABLE_AUTO_EXPOSURE.comment=Adapts to centre-weighted HDR log luminance. Disabling restores manual exposure and night shadow lift.
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_MIN=Minimum exposure
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_MAX=Maximum exposure
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_NIGHT_MAX=Night exposure limit
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_NIGHT_MAX.comment=Limits night compensation to preserve darkness, within the overall exposure limit.
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_RAIN_MAX=Rain exposure limit
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_RAIN_MAX.comment=Limits overcast compensation so rain is not brightened back to daylight.
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_SPEED=Adaptation speed
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_SPEED.comment=Smooth EV-based adaptation, faster in bright surroundings. Zoom, medium changes and long frames preserve exposure history.
option.COLOR_GRADE=Colour style
value.COLOR_GRADE.0=Neutral
value.COLOR_GRADE.1=Natural
value.COLOR_GRADE.2=Cinematic
option.COLOR_GRADE_STRENGTH=Grade strength
option.WHITE_BALANCE=White Balance
option.WHITE_BALANCE.comment=Negative values cool the image; positive values warm it while preserving luminance.
option.BLOOM_SCATTER=Bloom scatter
option.BLOOM_SCATTER.comment=Distributes weight between a narrow glow and four low-frequency levels. Zero keeps the narrow glow.

option.SSAO_QUALITY=Ambient Occlusion
option.SSAO_QUALITY.comment=Screen-space ambient obscurance for nearby contacts and corners. Only indirect lighting is attenuated; water and the first-person layer are excluded from occluder depth.
value.SSAO_QUALITY.0=Off
value.SSAO_QUALITY.1=Fast
value.SSAO_QUALITY.2=High
option.SSAO_STRENGTH=AO Strength
option.SSAO_STRENGTH.comment=Controls indirect-light shading at contacts. Direct illumination and material emission remain independent.

