option.EXPOSURE.comment=Brightness multiplier after automatic or manual metering. 1.0 applies no compensation.
option.NIGHT_EXPOSURE.comment=Night shadow lift for manual exposure. Automatic exposure uses its own night limit.
option.ENABLE_DITHER.comment=Adds subtle output dithering to reduce color banding.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Controls blocker search and shadow filtering. Hard shadows retain occlusion with fewer samples.
option.CLOUD_QUALITY.comment=Controls cloud ray-march samples. The volume resolution setting controls the internal viewport.
option.COLOURED_LIGHT_INTENSITY.comment=Blends native block lighting with colored results. 0 keeps native colors; 1 applies the full colored result.
option.WATER_REFLECTION_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Scales reflected radiance. Water reflection strength controls the separate blend weight.
option.ENABLE_MATERIAL_REFLECTIONS.comment=Enables rough environment response and direct highlights from resource-pack PBR materials.
option.MATERIAL_GLOSS_ROUGHNESS.comment=Limits the minimum material roughness. Higher values broaden highlights.
